    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hashing</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Frequency count</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/determine-if-two-strings-are-close/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 1657</a></div>\n  <h1>Determine if Two Strings Are Close</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: reordering makes the positions irrelevant and relabelling makes the letter names irrelevant, so two words are close exactly when they use the same set of letters and their letter counts form the same multiset. O(n) time, O(1) space (two arrays of 26 counters).</p>\n"
